{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>RobotKloud 是一款把簡報、PDF 或文件變成可互動朗讀工作區的工具，專為想把想法直接寫在頁面上、再聽回來的學生與在職人士而設。開啟 PDF 後，可在頁面任何位置加入筆記標記，輸入內容後由清晰自然的語音讀出，通勤或雙手忙碌時也能複習。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>頁面筆記與語音朗讀結合</h2>\n<p>在編寫模式中，雙擊頁面即可放置筆記並輸入文字，筆記能拖曳到其他頁面，也可用黃、藍、粉紅三色標示重點。朗讀模式會由上而下自然讀出筆記，開啟自動朗讀即可免持播放，並有逐字高亮跟讀。閱讀速度可選慢、正常或快，文字轉語音全程在裝置上完成，毋須帳戶，也不收集資料。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-624-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-625-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-626-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-627-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-628-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-629-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：RobotKloud</li>\n<li>應用類別：Business</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T23:18:33.233914+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}